3:T411,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I get an eye test today?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, many opticians offer same-day appointments. Search online for available slots or call your local optician to ask about today's availability. Weekday mornings and early afternoons are usually the easiest times to get a same-day appointment."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do I need to book or can I walk in?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Most opticians prefer bookings but many accept walk-ins when slots are available. Walk-in availability varies by location and how busy the practice is. Calling ahead is recommended to avoid a wasted journey."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is a same-day eye test more expensive?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. A same-day eye test costs the same as any other appointment. There is no premium for short-notice booking. If you qualify for a free NHS test, it is still free regardless of when you book."}}]}0:{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[[["$","$L2",null,{}],["$","main",null,{"className":"flex-1","children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"name\":\"Same-Day Eye Tests — Find Last-Minute Appointments Near You\",\"description\":\"Need an eye test today? Many opticians offer same-day appointments. Find available slots near you and book online.\",\"url\":\"https://www.eyetest.co.uk/find/same-day-eye-test\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"eyetest.co.uk\",\"url\":\"https://www.eyetest.co.uk\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"eyetest.co.uk\",\"url\":\"https://www.eyetest.co.uk\"},\"dateModified\":\"2026-06-16\",\"breadcrumb\":{\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://www.eyetest.co.uk\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\