c:["$","section",null,{"className":"py-16 sm:py-20","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-12","children":[["$","article",null,{"className":"lg:col-span-2","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"prose prose-gray max-w-none","children":[["$","p","0",{"className":"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-5 text-base","children":"If you need an eye test urgently, many opticians across the UK offer same-day appointments. Whether you have noticed a change in your vision, need an updated prescription quickly, or simply want to get your test done without waiting, same-day booking is widely available."}],["$","p","1",{"className":"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-5 text-base","children":"Major chains like Specsavers, Boots Opticians, and Vision Express typically have same-day slots available, particularly during quieter periods such as weekday mornings and early afternoons. Independent opticians may also be able to fit you in at short notice. The easiest way to find same-day availability is to search online — many opticians allow you to see available appointment times on their website and book instantly."}],["$","p","2",{"className":"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-5 text-base","children":"If your need is genuinely urgent — for example, sudden vision loss, flashes of light, a shower of new floaters, a painful red eye, or an eye injury — you should seek emergency eye care rather than a routine eye test. Many opticians are accredited to provide urgent eye care through the NHS Minor Eye Conditions Service (MECS), and can see you the same day for these urgent symptoms, often at no cost. This is typically faster and more appropriate than going to A&E."}],["$","p","3",{"className":"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-5 text-base","children":"For routine same-day appointments, it is worth calling your preferred optician first thing in the morning to ask about availability. Cancellations and no-shows mean that slots often open up throughout the day. If one practice cannot see you today, try another nearby — with multiple opticians in most town centres, there is usually someone who can help at short notice."}],["$","p","4",{"className":"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-5 text-base","children":"Same-day appointments are subject to the same standards as any other eye test. You will receive a full sight test covering your vision, prescription, and eye health. If you need glasses, you can order them the same day, with some opticians offering same-day collection on selected frames and lenses."}]]}]}],["$","aside",null,{"className":"lg:col-span-1","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"sticky top-8 space-y-6","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl shadow-sm p-6","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-[var(--color-navy)] mb-4","style":{"fontFamily":"var(--font-display)"},"children":"Key facts"}],["$","dl",null,{"className":"space-y-4","children":[["$","div","Same-day slots",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-[var(--color-primary)]/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0","children":["$","svg",null,{"className":"w-5 h-5 text-[var(--color-primary)]","fill":"currentColor","viewBox":"0 0 20 20","children":["$","path",null,{"fillRule":"evenodd","d":"M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z","clipRule":"evenodd"}]}]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"text-xs text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-wider font-medium","children":"Same-day slots"}],"$L13"]}]]}],"$L14","$L15","$L16"]}]]}],"$L17","$L18"]}]}]]}]}]}]
